==Icelandic==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|is|takk fyrir seinast}}

===Etymology===
From {{l|is|takk fyrir||thanks}} + {{l|is|síðast||last, last time}}. Compare {{cog|fo|takk fyri seinast}}, {{cog|da|tak for sidst}}, {{cog|no|takk for sist}} and {{cog|sv|tack för senast}}.

===Phrase===
{{head|is|phrase}}

# [[thanks]] for [[last time]]

====Usage notes====
* Commonly said when meeting someone after a long time, or simply after having spent time together.

